# Principal
# --------------------
# No secrets, no database.
# With "network_mode: host", the real bind port is netdata.conf's own [web] "default port" (19999 by default, unless you edit ./config/netdata.conf after first boot).
# NETDATA_WEB_HTTP here only documents/reserves that port for Caddy routing, it doesn't change what Netdata itself binds to.
